{"seq":3,"slug":"query-optimization","title":"查询优化实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/performance-tuning/query-optimization","wordCount":724,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"查询优化实践\">查询优化实践</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>查询优化是从 SQL 编写到数据库配置的全链路优化过程。优化的目标不是让每条查询都最快，而是在系统整体负载下达到最优的资源利用率和响应时间。优化遵循&quot;先测量，后优化&quot;原则——不看执行计划就改 SQL 是盲目的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[性能问题发现] --&gt; B[慢查询日志分析]&#10;    B --&gt; C[EXPLAIN ANALYZE]&#10;    C --&gt; D{瓶颈类型}&#10;    D --&gt;|扫描问题| E[索引优化]&#10;    D --&gt;|连接问题| F[查询改写]&#10;    D --&gt;|排序问题| G[索引 + work_mem]&#10;    D --&gt;|数据量问题| H[分区 + 归档]&#10;&#10;    E --&gt; I[验证优化效果]&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[监控回归]\">graph TD\n    A[性能问题发现] --&gt; B[慢查询日志分析]\n    B --&gt; C[EXPLAIN ANALYZE]\n    C --&gt; D{瓶颈类型}\n    D --&gt;|扫描问题| E[索引优化]\n    D --&gt;|连接问题| F[查询改写]\n    D --&gt;|排序问题| G[索引 + work_mem]\n    D --&gt;|数据量问题| H[分区 + 归档]\n\n    E --&gt; I[验证优化效果]\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[监控回归]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化层次</th>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>影响范围</th>\n<th>实施成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SQL 层</td>\n<td>查询改写、索引优化</td>\n<td>单查询</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表结构层</td>\n<td>分区、反范式化</td>\n<td>整表</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置层</td>\n<td>参数调优</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>架构层</td>\n<td>读写分离、缓存</td>\n<td>全系统</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"常见-sql-反模式\">常见 SQL 反模式</h2><p>许多性能问题源自 SQL 编写的不良习惯。识别并消除这些反模式是优化的第一步。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const antiPatterns = `&#10;-- 反模式 1：SELECT *（浪费 I/O 和网络带宽）&#10;-- 差&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100;&#10;-- 好&#10;SELECT order_id, amount, created_at FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100;&#10;&#10;-- 反模式 2：索引列上使用函数&#10;-- 差（索引失效）&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE YEAR(created_at) = 2024;&#10;-- 好（利用索引范围扫描）&#10;SELECT * FROM users &#10;WHERE created_at &gt;= &#39;2024-01-01&#39; AND created_at &lt; &#39;2025-01-01&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 反模式 3：隐式类型转换&#10;-- 差（varchar 列与数字比较导致全表扫描）&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE phone = 13800138000;&#10;-- 好&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE phone = &#39;13800138000&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 反模式 4：OR 条件导致索引失效&#10;-- 差&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100 OR status = 1;&#10;-- 好（改写为 UNION ALL）&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE status = 1 AND user_id &lt;&gt; 100;&#10;&#10;-- 反模式 5：NOT IN 子查询包含 NULL&#10;-- 差&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id NOT IN (SELECT user_id FROM blocked);&#10;-- 好&#10;SELECT * FROM users u &#10;WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM blocked b WHERE b.user_id = u.user_id);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> antiPatterns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 反模式 1：SELECT *（浪费 I/O 和网络带宽）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT order_id, amount, created_at FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 反模式 2：索引列上使用函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 差（索引失效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users WHERE YEAR(created_at) = 2024;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 好（利用索引范围扫描）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE created_at >= '2024-01-01' AND created_at &#x3C; '2025-01-01';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 反模式 3：隐式类型转换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 差（varchar 列与数字比较导致全表扫描）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users WHERE phone = 13800138000;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users WHERE phone = '13800138000';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 反模式 4：OR 条件导致索引失效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100 OR status = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 好（改写为 UNION ALL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM orders WHERE status = 1 AND user_id &#x3C;> 100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 反模式 5：NOT IN 子查询包含 NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id NOT IN (SELECT user_id FROM blocked);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM users u </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM blocked b WHERE b.user_id = u.user_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>问题根因</th>\n<th>优化方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SELECT *</td>\n<td>传输无用列</td>\n<td>明确列出需要的列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数包裹索引列</td>\n<td>索引失效</td>\n<td>改写条件或创建函数索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐式类型转换</td>\n<td>优化器无法使用索引</td>\n<td>保持类型一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大范围 OR</td>\n<td>无法有效使用索引</td>\n<td>UNION ALL 或 IN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NOT IN + NULL</td>\n<td>三值逻辑陷阱</td>\n<td>NOT EXISTS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"n-1-查询问题\">N+1 查询问题</h2><p>N+1 问题是应用层最常见的性能杀手：先查询主表获取 N 条记录，然后对每条记录发起一次子查询获取关联数据，总共执行 N+1 次查询。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const nPlusOnePatterns = `&#10;-- N+1 问题（应用层伪代码）&#10;-- 1 次查询获取用户列表&#10;-- SELECT user_id, username FROM users LIMIT 100;&#10;-- 然后对每个用户执行 1 次查询&#10;-- for each user: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders WHERE user_id = ?&#10;&#10;-- 优化：单次 JOIN 查询&#10;SELECT u.user_id, u.username, COALESCE(o.order_count, 0) AS order_count&#10;FROM users u&#10;LEFT JOIN (&#10;    SELECT user_id, COUNT(*) AS order_count&#10;    FROM orders&#10;    GROUP BY user_id&#10;) o ON u.user_id = o.user_id&#10;LIMIT 100;&#10;&#10;-- 或者使用 LATERAL&#10;SELECT u.user_id, u.username, o.order_count&#10;FROM users u&#10;CROSS JOIN LATERAL (&#10;    SELECT COUNT(*) AS order_count&#10;    FROM orders&#10;    WHERE orders.user_id = u.user_id&#10;) o&#10;LIMIT 100;&#10;&#10;-- 批量 IN 查询（ORM 常用优化）&#10;-- 将 N 次查询合并为 1 次：&#10;SELECT user_id, COUNT(*) AS order_count&#10;FROM orders&#10;WHERE user_id IN (1, 2, 3, ..., 100)&#10;GROUP BY user_id;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nPlusOnePatterns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- N+1 问题（应用层伪代码）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 1 次查询获取用户列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- SELECT user_id, username FROM users LIMIT 100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 然后对每个用户执行 1 次查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- for each user: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders WHERE user_id = ?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 优化：单次 JOIN 查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.user_id, u.username, COALESCE(o.order_count, 0) AS order_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LEFT JOIN (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT user_id, COUNT(*) AS order_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) o ON u.user_id = o.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LIMIT 100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 或者使用 LATERAL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.user_id, u.username, o.order_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CROSS JOIN LATERAL (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT COUNT(*) AS order_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE orders.user_id = u.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LIMIT 100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 批量 IN 查询（ORM 常用优化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 将 N 次查询合并为 1 次：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT user_id, COUNT(*) AS order_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE user_id IN (1, 2, 3, ..., 100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY user_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"大表查询优化\">大表查询优化</h2><p>当表的数据量达到千万级别，常规优化手段可能不够，需要从表结构层面考虑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const largeTableOptimization = `&#10;-- 分区表（PostgreSQL 声明式分区）&#10;CREATE TABLE orders (&#10;    order_id BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY,&#10;    user_id BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;    amount DECIMAL(12, 2),&#10;    created_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE NOT NULL&#10;) PARTITION BY RANGE (created_at);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE orders_2024_q1 PARTITION OF orders&#10;    FOR VALUES FROM (&#39;2024-01-01&#39;) TO (&#39;2024-04-01&#39;);&#10;CREATE TABLE orders_2024_q2 PARTITION OF orders&#10;    FOR VALUES FROM (&#39;2024-04-01&#39;) TO (&#39;2024-07-01&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 查询自动命中对应分区（Partition Pruning）&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE created_at &gt;= &#39;2024-03-01&#39;;&#10;-- 只扫描 orders_2024_q1，跳过其他分区&#10;&#10;-- 归档历史数据&#10;-- 将旧数据移到归档表，保持主表精简&#10;INSERT INTO orders_archive SELECT * FROM orders WHERE created_at &lt; &#39;2023-01-01&#39;;&#10;DELETE FROM orders WHERE created_at &lt; &#39;2023-01-01&#39;;&#10;VACUUM FULL orders;&#10;&#10;-- 物化视图（预计算聚合）&#10;CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW daily_order_stats AS&#10;SELECT &#10;    DATE_TRUNC(&#39;day&#39;, created_at) AS day,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS order_count,&#10;    SUM(amount) AS total_amount,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) AS unique_users&#10;FROM orders&#10;GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC(&#39;day&#39;, created_at);&#10;&#10;-- 定期刷新&#10;REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW CONCURRENTLY daily_order_stats;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> largeTableOptimization</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 分区表（PostgreSQL 声明式分区）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE TABLE orders (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    order_id BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    user_id BIGINT NOT NULL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    amount DECIMAL(12, 2),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    created_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) PARTITION BY RANGE (created_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE TABLE orders_2024_q1 PARTITION OF orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FOR VALUES FROM ('2024-01-01') TO ('2024-04-01');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE TABLE orders_2024_q2 PARTITION OF orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FOR VALUES FROM ('2024-04-01') TO ('2024-07-01');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查询自动命中对应分区（Partition Pruning）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM orders WHERE created_at >= '2024-03-01';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 只扫描 orders_2024_q1，跳过其他分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 归档历史数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 将旧数据移到归档表，保持主表精简</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO orders_archive SELECT * FROM orders WHERE created_at &#x3C; '2023-01-01';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DELETE FROM orders WHERE created_at &#x3C; '2023-01-01';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VACUUM FULL orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 物化视图（预计算聚合）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW daily_order_stats AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    DATE_TRUNC('day', created_at) AS day,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) AS order_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SUM(amount) AS total_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) AS unique_users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC('day', created_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 定期刷新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW CONCURRENTLY daily_order_stats;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分区表</td>\n<td>数据有明确分区键</td>\n<td>分区裁剪减少扫描</td>\n<td>管理复杂度增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史归档</td>\n<td>热数据远小于总量</td>\n<td>主表更快</td>\n<td>需要归档流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物化视图</td>\n<td>聚合查询频繁</td>\n<td>预计算秒级返回</td>\n<td>数据延迟 + 存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读写分离</td>\n<td>读多写少</td>\n<td>分担主库压力</td>\n<td>架构复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"参数调优\">参数调优</h2><p>数据库配置参数对查询性能有全局性影响。以下是 PostgreSQL 中最重要的几个参数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const configTuning = `&#10;-- work_mem：排序和哈希操作的内存限制&#10;-- 默认 4MB，复杂查询可能不够&#10;SET work_mem = &#39;256MB&#39;;  -- 会话级别&#10;&#10;-- shared_buffers：数据缓存池大小&#10;-- 通常设为物理内存的 25%&#10;-- shared_buffers = &#39;4GB&#39;  -- 需要重启&#10;&#10;-- effective_cache_size：告诉优化器可用的缓存总量&#10;-- 设为物理内存的 50-75%&#10;-- effective_cache_size = &#39;12GB&#39;&#10;&#10;-- random_page_cost：随机 I/O 相对成本&#10;-- SSD 磁盘设为 1.1-1.5（默认 4.0 适合 HDD）&#10;-- random_page_cost = 1.1&#10;&#10;-- 查看当前参数&#10;SHOW work_mem;&#10;SHOW shared_buffers;&#10;&#10;-- 查看运行时统计&#10;SELECT * FROM pg_stat_user_tables &#10;WHERE n_dead_tup &gt; 10000;  -- 需要 VACUUM 的表&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> configTuning</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- work_mem：排序和哈希操作的内存限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 默认 4MB，复杂查询可能不够</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SET work_mem = '256MB';  -- 会话级别</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- shared_buffers：数据缓存池大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 通常设为物理内存的 25%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- shared_buffers = '4GB'  -- 需要重启</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- effective_cache_size：告诉优化器可用的缓存总量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 设为物理内存的 50-75%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- effective_cache_size = '12GB'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- random_page_cost：随机 I/O 相对成本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- SSD 磁盘设为 1.1-1.5（默认 4.0 适合 HDD）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- random_page_cost = 1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查看当前参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SHOW work_mem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SHOW shared_buffers;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查看运行时统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM pg_stat_user_tables </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE n_dead_tup > 10000;  -- 需要 VACUUM 的表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>参数调优应该基于实际的工作负载分析，而非简单照搬推荐值。使用 pg_stat_statements 收集查询统计，找出消耗资源最多的查询，针对性优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>查询优化遵循&quot;先测量（EXPLAIN ANALYZE），后优化&quot;原则，避免盲目调整</li>\n<li>SELECT * 、函数包裹索引列、隐式类型转换是最常见的 SQL 反模式</li>\n<li>N+1 查询是应用层最大的性能杀手，通过 JOIN 或批量 IN 查询解决</li>\n<li>大表优化从分区、归档、物化视图和读写分离四个层面考虑</li>\n<li>参数调优关注 work_mem（排序/哈希内存）、shared_buffers（缓存池）和 random_page_cost（SSD 调整）</li>\n<li>使用 pg_stat_statements 定位高消耗查询，针对性优化而非全局调参</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"查询优化实践","id":"查询优化实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"常见 SQL 反模式","id":"常见-sql-反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"N+1 查询问题","id":"n-1-查询问题"},{"level":2,"text":"大表查询优化","id":"大表查询优化"},{"level":2,"text":"参数调优","id":"参数调优"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"执行计划解读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/performance-tuning/query-plans"},"next":{"title":"聚合分析模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/analytical-sql/aggregation-patterns"}}